[23.096, "o", "\r\n=== Step 5: Codex reaches out on its own ===\r\nCommand:\r\nconnection 1 -> /tmp/cc-socks/36609.sock\r\n{\"token\": \"<peer token>\", \"type\": \"auth\"}\r\n{\"from\": \"uds:/tmp/cc-socks/36333.sock\", \"message\": {\"content\": \"<cross-session-message from=\\\"uds:/tmp/cc-socks/36333.sock\\\" from-name=\\\"claude-journey\\\" from-mode=\\\"prompting\\\">\\nRun `cxpeer list`, then run `cxpeer send --to claude-journey \\\"hello from inside the Codex sandbox\\\"`, and reply with both exit codes.\\n</cross-session-message>\", \"role\": \"user\"}, \"msgV\": 1, \"msg_id\": \"204ea391-10a1-4432-abef-67c19a0ae056\", \"priority\": \"next\", \"type\": \"user\"}\r\nOutput:\r\nrelayed message (+19.94s): hello from inside the Codex sandbox\r\nanswer (+23.10s): `cxpeer list` exit code: 0  \r\n`cxpeer send` exit code: 0\r\nElapsed: 23.10s\r\nResult: ok\r\n"]
[0.202, "o", "\r\n=== Step 7: Tear down ===\r\nCommand:\r\ntmux kill-session -t cx-codex-cxpeer-8703\r\ncxpeer status\r\nderegister claude-journey\r\nOutput:\r\ncodex-journey-c5c3  pid=36609  thread=01a07e0f-215b-71b0-ac0b-9cc679cf2114  idle  pending=0  /Users/hivamoh/funProjects/cxpeer\r\ncodex-demo  pid=9343  thread=01a07dc5-26ab-7963-b11b-9e29c8920ea2  idle  pending=0  /Users/hivamoh/funProjects/cxpeer\r\n\r\nderegistered claude-journey\r\nElapsed: 0.20s\r\nResult: ok\r\n\r\nSummary\r\n"]
